[[div class="blockquote"]]
This is a blockquote, created by enclosing its contents with {{[[div class="blockquote"]]}} on the line before and {{[[/div]]}} on the line after.

-----

[[div class="blockquote"]]
Blockquotes, and all divs, can be nested.
[[/div]]
[[/div]]

||~ Here's an ||~ example ||
